<h5>Access API</h5>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-8">The default <em>actions</em> are RESTful:</div>
	<div class="col-2">Default <em>action</em></div>
	<div class="col-2">Meaning</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>GET</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-7"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>topics</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>LIST all</em></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>GET</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-7"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT/ID</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>edit</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>READ record</em></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>POST</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-7"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>insert</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>CREATE new</em></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>PUT</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-7"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>update</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>UPDATE record</em></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>DELETE</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-7"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>delete</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>DELETE record</em></div>
</div>
<p></p>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-12">If <code>action=insert|edit|topics|update|delete</code> is assigned, it will override the defaults in all HTTP methods.</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>GET</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-11"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT?action=ACTION&query</code></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>POST</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-11"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/COMPONENT</code> (with <code>action=</code> in body)</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-12">Here are your <em>ROLE</em> and <em>COMPONENT</em>:</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><hr></div>
	<div class="col-2">All ROLEs</div>
	<div class="col-1"><hr></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><em>Public</em></div>
	<div class="col-1"><em>Admin</em></div>
	<div class="col-2"><em>Login Required</em></div>
	<div class="col-2">COMPONENTs</div>
	<div class="col-2">Script</div>
	<div class="col-4">Server URL</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><code>[% item.Pubrole %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-1"><code>[% item.admin_role %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>[% item.db_roles %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>[% item.db_comps %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-2"><code>[% item.Script %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-4"><code>[% item.Server_url %]</code></div>
</div>
<p></p>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-12">Data received at Status <em>OK 200</em>:</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Successful:</div>
	<div class="col-10"><code>{"success":true, "incomings":HASH, "included":HASH, "data":ARRAY OF HASH, "relationships":HASH OF <em>data</em>}</code></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Login Required:</div>
	<div class="col-10"><code>{"data":"[% item.Challenge %]"}</code></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Found Error:</div>
	<div class="col-10"><code>{"success":false, "error":CODE, "errorstr":STRING}</code></div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h5>Login API</h5>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>POST:</strong></div>
	<div class="col-11"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/login</code></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Data Sent:</div>
	<div class="col-3">For ROLE</div>
	<div class="col-3">Cookie Expected</div>
	<div class="col-4">JSON</div>
</div>
[% FOREACH role=item.Whos %]<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2"></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code>[% role.role %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code>[% role.cookie %]</code></div>
	<div class="col-4"><code>{[% role.login %]:ACCOUNT, [% role.pass %]:PASSWORD}</code></div>
</div>[% END %]
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Data Received:</div>
	<div class="col-3">Successful</div>
	<div class="col-3">What to Follow</div>
	<div class="col-4">Failed</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2"></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code>{"data":"[% item.Logged %]"}</code></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code><em>Send the Role Cookie</em></code></div>
	<div class="col-4"><code>{"data":"[% item.Failed %]"}</code></div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h5>Logout API</h5>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-1"><strong>POST</strong>:</div>
	<div class="col-11"><code>[% item.Server_url %][% item.Script %]/ROLE/json/logout</code></div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-2">Data Received:</div>
	<div class="col-3">Successful</div>
	<div class="col-3">What to Follow</div>
	<div class="col-4">Failed</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-2"></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code>{"data":"[% item.Logout %]"}</code></div>
	<div class="col-3"><code><em>Remove the Role Cookie</em></code></div>
	<div class="col-4"><code><em>All Others</em></code></div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h5>Files On Server</h5>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-6">Document_root</div>
	<div class="col-6">Template</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-6"><code>[% item.Document_root %]</code></div>
